{"id":"n23044-1-8","stage":5,"title":"강간 · 强奸","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23044-1-8-1","ko":"날이 갈수록 강간 범죄가 늘어나고 있대요.","zh":"听说强奸犯罪日益增多。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"날이","meaning":"日子，时光","explanation":"날：日子，时光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62254","senseId":"5","lemma":"날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈수록","meaning":"到达，迈向","explanation":"가다：到达，迈向；ㄹ수록：表示程度随之变化：“越……越……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"9","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강간","meaning":"强奸，强暴","explanation":"강간：强奸，强暴","readings":[{"term":"강간","audio":"/audio/49253944cf3c109168f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23044","senseId":"1","lemma":"강간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"범죄가","meaning":"犯罪","explanation":"범죄：犯罪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"범죄","audio":"/audio/8b4af74dbc96d5c72211.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14457","senseId":"1","lemma":"범죄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘어나고","meaning":"增，涨，扩大","explanation":"늘어나다：增，涨，扩大；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"늘어나다","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62833","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있대요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"818c8a303c20bac0","term":"날","zh":"日子，时光","audio":"/audio/818c8a303c20bac05fae.mp3","entryId":"62254","definition":"某种时节或时候。","pronunciation":["날"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"到达，迈向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"朝向某种状态或状况前进。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"49253944cf3c1091","term":"강간","zh":"强奸，强暴","audio":"/audio/49253944cf3c109168f9.mp3","entryId":"23044","definition":"对不情愿的对象施以暴行或威胁对方强制发生性关系。","pronunciation":["강ː간"]},{"id":"8b4af74dbc96d5c7","term":"범죄","zh":"犯罪","audio":"/audio/8b4af74dbc96d5c72211.mp3","entryId":"14457","definition":"违反法律，犯下罪行。","pronunciation":["범ː죄","범ː줴"]},{"id":"ba47d0c0fad38891","term":"늘어나다","zh":"增，涨，扩大","audio":"/audio/ba47d0c0fad388914dca.mp3","entryId":"62833","definition":"体积、数量或程度比原来渐渐变大或变多。","pronunciation":["느러나다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/93dba189daf39cb2d934.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23044-1-8-2","ko":"맞아요. 여성들은 무서워서 밤길도 혼자 못 다니겠어요.","zh":"是啊，女性都害怕得不敢独自走夜路了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아요.","meaning":"对，中","explanation":"맞다：对，中；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여성들은","meaning":"女性","explanation":"여성：女性；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여성","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67727","senseId":"1","lemma":"여성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무서워서","meaning":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","explanation":"무섭다：怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"무섭다","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55637","senseId":"1","lemma":"무섭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"밤길도","meaning":"夜路","explanation":"밤길：夜路；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"밤길","audio":"/audio/7e69645285ed900e62c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58001","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니겠어요.","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"对，中","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"言语、六感或事实等没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"f414772fbd2cdd33","term":"여성","zh":"女性","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3","entryId":"67727","definition":"成年后可生育孩子的女子。","pronunciation":["여성"]},{"id":"6c5692ebced898c0","term":"무섭다","zh":"怕，害怕，可怕，恐惧","audio":"/audio/6c5692ebced898c0376c.mp3","entryId":"55637","definition":"忌讳某个对象或担心出什么事。","pronunciation":["무섭따"]},{"id":"7e69645285ed900e","term":"밤길","zh":"夜路","audio":"/audio/7e69645285ed900e62c5.mp3","entryId":"58001","definition":"日落后变暗的路。","pronunciation":["밤낄"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/15dc6bbead54661de3ec.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.193,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23044","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativeco